## Output Format

When generating a diagram, always output in this structure:

```markdown
## 📐 <Diagram Title>
**Type:** <Diagram Type> | **Audience:** <Technical/Non-Technical/Both>
**Description:** <1-2 sentence explanation of what this diagram shows>

<MERMAID CODE BLOCK>

### Legend
| Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| → | Synchronous call |
| ⟶ (dashed) | Asynchronous event |
| DB shape | Persistent storage |
```

